; The code store, one flat image, the 14 bodies in id order, and loadable RAM since P2:
; OP_LOAD_PAGE overwrites any 32-byte page of it, OP_RUN_USER executes from any offset.
; Reading code[pad] gives zero; the engine never reads there because the run-length
; guard fires first.
